ore Marble generations without discussing why they would improve the results.\n\nPlease start with the Screen 08 texture-matching test now.\n\nDO NOT REDESIGN MY APPROVED SCENERY.", "operation": "enqueue", "sessionId": "03b94f36-3d2a-53ac-a9c6-c76da0a815ed", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T13:13:05.930Z", "type": "queue-operation"}
